---------------------------------------

The Kyro binary contains the following Go modules. Their source code is not
part of this repository; the Go toolchain downloads it at build time. The
versions are recorded in go.mod.

  * github.com/jfjallid/go-smb
             Copyright (c) 2023 Jimmy Fjällid. MIT License.
             According to its README it is based on
             github.com/stacktitan/smb.

  * github.com/jfjallid/golog
             Copyright (c) 2022 Jimmy Fjällid. MIT License.

  * github.com/jfjallid/gofork
             A fork of parts of the Go standard library.
             Copyright (c) 2009 The Go Authors. BSD 3-Clause License.

  * github.com/jfjallid/gokrb5/v9
             A fork of the gokrb5 Kerberos library.
             Apache License, version 2.0.

  * github.com/jfjallid/mstypes
             A fork of github.com/jcmturner/rpc (mstypes).
             Apache License, version 2.0.

  * github.com/jfjallid/ndr
             A fork of github.com/jcmturner/rpc (ndr).
             Apache License, version 2.0.

  * go.yaml.in/yaml/v3
             Copyright (c) 2011-2019 Canonical Ltd.
             Apache License, version 2.0. Parts under the MIT License,
             Copyright (c) 2006-2011 Kirill Simonov.

  * golang.org/x/crypto
  * golang.org/x/net
             Copyright 2009 The Go Authors. BSD 3-Clause License.

  * software.sslmate.com/src/go-pkcs12
             Copyright (c) 2015, 2018, 2019 Opsmate, Inc.
             Copyright (c) 2009 The Go Authors. BSD 3-Clause License.

The full license text of each module is in the LICENSE file of that module.
All of these licenses are compatible with the GNU General Public License,
version 3.

Third-party software used alongside Kyro
----------------------------------------

Kyro is intended to be used together with the following third-party programs.
They are intended to be used as separate, unmodified binaries. They are not
part of this repository's code, and no source code or binaries of these
projects are included in this repository.

  * iPXE     https://ipxe.org/
             Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.

  * wimboot  https://github.com/ipxe/wimboot
             Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.

Each of these projects remains under its own license and copyright. See the
respective upstream project for details.

